vhlocal
=======

This project is a stdlib-only local runner for the VulnHunter vulnerability-hunting
methodology, targeting a self-hosted LLM (Ollama or any OpenAI-compatible server
such as mlx_lm / vLLM) instead of Claude Code.

Portions of this project are derived from VulnHunter by Capital One:

    VulnHunter
    Copyright Capital One Services, LLC
    https://github.com/capitalone/VulnHunter
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

In particular, the vulnerability-hunting phase methodology bundled under
`skill/` (SKILL.md and `skill/phases/*.md`) originates from VulnHunter and
remains under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Some phase prompts have been
modified for the self-hosted, single-GPU execution model.

